<title>USA: Cygne cuts its stake in AnnTaylor.</title>
<headline>Cygne cuts its stake in AnnTaylor.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cygne Designs Inc said Thursday it cut its stake in AnnTaylor Stores Corp to 1,230,145 common shares or 4.8 percent from 5.9 percent previously held.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Cygne said its latest transactions include the sale of 276,500 common shares between Nov 12 and Nov 20 at prices ranging from $19.25 to $20.625 per share.</p>
<p>The New York based company is a national speciality retailer of better quality women's apparel, shoes and accesories sold primarily under the Ann Taylor brand name.</p>
</text>
